            "explanation": "Điều kiện xác định: $2x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\ne \\frac{\\pi}{2} + k\\pi \\Leftrightarrow 2x \\ne \\frac{3\\pi}{4} + k\\pi \\Leftrightarrow x \\ne \\frac{3\\pi}{8} + k\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ ($k \\in \\mathbb{Z}$). Vậy $D = \\mathbb{R} \\setminus \\{\\frac{3\\pi}{8} + k\\frac{\\pi}{2}, k \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\}$."
