            "explanation": "Liên hợp: $L = \\lim_{x \\to 4} \\frac{2x + 1 - 9}{(x - 4)(\\sqrt{2x + 1} + 3)} = \\lim_{x \\to 4} \\frac{2(x - 4)}{(x - 4)(\\sqrt{2x + 1} + 3)} = \\frac{2}{3 + 3} = \\frac{1}{3}$."
