            "explanation": "a) $y' = (3x^4 - 5x^3 + x^2 - 1)' = 12x^3 - 15x^2 + 2x$. $y'' = (12x^3 - 15x^2 + 2x)' = 36x^2 - 30x + 2$. b) $y' = (\\sin(4x))' = 4\\cos(4x)$. $y'' = (4\\cos(4x))' = 4 \\cdot (-4\\sin(4x)) = -16\\sin(4x)$."
